### Address Book API Testing File

### Get All Contacts

GET http://localhost:8080/contacts
Accept: application/json

### Add New Contact

POST http://localhost:8080/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Rishita",
  "lastName": "Sharma",
  "address": "Street 15",
  "city": "Allahabad",
  "state": "Uttar Pradesh",
  "zip": "211006",
  "phoneNumber": "9876543210",
  "email": "[rishita@gmail.com](mailto:rishita@gmail.com)"
}

### Add Another Contact

POST http://localhost:8080/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Hardik",
  "lastName": "Verma",
  "address": "Sector 10",
  "city": "Noida",
  "state": "Uttar Pradesh",
  "zip": "201301",
  "phoneNumber": "9123456780",
  "email": "[hardik@gmail.com](mailto:hardik@gmail.com)"
}

### Update Contact

PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Rishita",
  "lastName": "Sharma",
  "address": "Street 45",
  "city": "Gurgaon",
  "state": "Haryana",
  "zip": "122001",
  "phoneNumber": "9999999999",
  "email": "[rishita.sharma@gmail.com](mailto:rishita.sharma@gmail.com)"
}

### Delete Contact

DELETE http://localhost:8080/contacts/1
Accept: application/json

### Search Contact By City (UC7)

GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/city/Noida
Accept: application/json

### Search Contact By State (UC7)

GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/state/Uttar Pradesh
Accept: application/json

### Count Contacts By City (UC9)

GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/count/city/Noida
Accept: application/json

### Count Contacts By State (UC9)

GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/count/state/Uttar Pradesh
Accept: application/json

### Sort Contacts By Name (UC10)

GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/sort/name
Accept: application/json

### Sort Contacts By City (UC11)

GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/sort/city
Accept: application/json

### Sort Contacts By State (UC11)

GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/sort/state
Accept: application/json

### Sort Contacts By Zip (UC11)

GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/sort/zip
Accept: application/json
